        "solutionVisible": false,
        "figure": "none",
        "prompt": "Решите уравнение \\(2x^2-5x-3=0\\).",
        "answer": "−0,5; 3",
        "comment": "\\(D=(-5)^2-4\\cdot2\\cdot(-3)=49\\).\n\\(x_{1,2}=\\frac{5\\pm\\sqrt{49}}{4}\\).\n\\(x_1=-\\frac12\\), \\(x_2=3\\).",
